# The no-multilib profile masks abi_x86_32 but lets the PE packages out of
# it, since what they build is a Windows DLL rather than a library for this
# machine. app-emulation/d7vk is not in ::gentoo so it is not on that list,
# and the games it exists for are thirty two bit.
app-emulation/d7vk -abi_x86_32
